{
  "name": "41 · Delivery Status Updater (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 41 · Delivery Status Updater\nChange an order's **Status** in your sheet (packed → shipped → out for delivery → delivered) and the customer gets a short WhatsApp update. **Delayed, cancelled or problem orders go to the owner first**: no awkward auto-messages.\n\n**Setup (10 min)**\n1. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Orders**: Order ID, Customer, Phone, Item, Status, Tracking, Note, Notified status.\n2. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup). Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n3. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nCustomers must have messaged you in the last 24 hours, or switch **Tell customer** to an approved template.",
        "height": 637,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "2f0e17ba-87d2-417c-8892-7ab0198ef87a",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 30
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "08a5cd28-f03f-432b-981a-0b87e48aff0a",
      "name": "Every 30 min",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Orders"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "12a6d169-6486-44f5-b163-3d1f85608ec3",
      "name": "Orders",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Orders tab: Order ID, Customer, Phone, Item, Status (packed / shipped / out for delivery / delivered / delayed), Tracking, Note, Notified status\nreturn $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r['Order ID'] && r.Phone && r.Status && r.Status !== r['Notified status']).map(json => ({ json }));"
      },
      "id": "deb9dd04-c28b-4b34-8757-de3a6ae56039",
      "name": "Status changed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Write a WhatsApp order update from YOUR BUSINESS NAME.\nCustomer: {{ $json.Customer }}\nOrder: {{ $json['Order ID'] }} – {{ $json.Item }}\nNew status: {{ $json.Status }}\nTracking: {{ $json.Tracking || 'none' }}\nStaff note: {{ $json.Note || 'none' }}\n\nmessage: max 3 short lines, 'Hello <first name> ji', the new status in plain words, tracking link if there is one. No delivery date unless the staff note gives one. handoff=true (and reason) if the status is 'delayed', 'cancelled', 'returned', or the note mentions a problem: those go to the owner first, not the customer.\nRULES (never break these): You are an assistant for YOUR BUSINESS NAME, a small Indian business, not the owner. Never offer or hint at discounts, refunds, free items or compensation. Never promise delivery dates, results or guarantees that are not given in this prompt. Never invent prices, stock, policies or facts: use ONLY the data given in this prompt. Greet with 'Hello <name> ji' (never 'Namaste'). Reply in the customer's language (English, Hindi or Hinglish in Roman script).",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "85cabae2-6c18-4380-8c80-f45583dc939a",
      "name": "AI writes update",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.3
        }
      },
      "id": "2362eb25-d61e-4bc1-9d6f-e224fa296820",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        660,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"message\": \"Hello Rahul ji, your order #1042 (cotton kurta) is out for delivery today 🚚\",\n  \"handoff\": false,\n  \"reason\": \"\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "d4292b81-9da1-437a-8c65-00f0cb108c49",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.handoff }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "bb77e925-5ec0-46bb-b06c-929fcfbb94fe",
      "name": "Owner first?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP",
        "textBody": "=⚠️ Order {{ $('Status changed?').item.json['Order ID'] }} ({{ $('Status changed?').item.json.Customer }}) is *{{ $('Status changed?').item.json.Status }}*: {{ $json.output.reason }}\nCall the customer yourself. Suggested message:\n{{ $json.output.message }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "3471a641-4c2c-40d5-b5dd-ded98b044cb7",
      "name": "Tell owner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Status changed?').item.json.Phone }}",
        "textBody": "={{ $json.output.message }}\n– YOUR BUSINESS NAME",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "c184ea3e-6daf-4e18-b570-2ca226698bab",
      "name": "Tell customer",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1340,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const r = $('Status changed?').item.json;\nreturn { json: { 'Order ID': r['Order ID'], 'Notified status': r.Status } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
